# Secrets for api_server.py's unified gateway — the ONE process that
# serves ALL 5 accounts' /{account}/status, /{account}/start,
# /{account}/stop, /accounts, and /stop-all over one port/public URL.
#
# Copy this file to .env.gateway (gitignored — never commit real values):
#   cp .env.gateway.example .env.gateway
#
# This is intentionally SEPARATE from any per-account .env.<account>'s
# API_KEY (which the gateway no longer uses at all). One shared master key
# controls every account through the gateway — see SETUP.md for why a
# single key is the right call for this single-user setup, rather than a
# different key per account.

# Every request to api_server.py must send this exact value in the
# X-API-Key header. Generate a long random value, e.g. in PowerShell:
#   -join ((48..57)+(65..90)+(97..122)|Get-Random -Count 40|%{[char]$_})
API_KEY=
